WEBVTT

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:15.540
Honesty will secede from
the Round Table Conference.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:19.450
And then we'll call for founding a new assembly,

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:22.540
the Akiba Government.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:27.790
I have... duties in this town.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.410
I cannot just abandon them.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:34.580
I knew from the start it
would turn out this way.

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:38.540
It reached its limit. Our duty is over.

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.870
On that day, the "Apocalypse" occurred.

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:44.910
It trapped us players in a world that
looked just like the one in the game.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.950
A little over a year has passed since then.

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:49.990
The Adventurers in Akiba
have lived helping each other

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:52.660
under the Round Table Conference's leadership.

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:57.120
Round Table Decrement,
the eleven reps at the Round Table.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:58.910
Before we knew it,

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:03.200
we became a warped circle
that could fall apart at any time.

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:08.870
The Round Table Conference is coming to an end.

