00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:43.010
Akiba - Japan Server

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:43.540
Several weeks before that day...

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:47.910
Princess!

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:47.910
Good morning!

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.580
Things are changing every day in Akiba,

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:55.540
and I see much more
People of the Land here, Miss Allie.

00:02:55.570 --> 00:03:01.530
Rayneshia's Marriage

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:00.370
"Rayneshia's Marriage."

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:06.740
Luquenje Hall, Guild Building

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:08.160
Regarding lunar communications,
the issue we're currently facing is

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:12.210
Roderick, Roderick Merchant
Guild - Guild Master

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:12.370
the development of electronic circuits
required for a high-precision sensor.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:16.210
Michitaka, Marine Agency
- General Manager

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:16.490
So, it's a technical issue rather
than a monetary one, huh?

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:20.990
By communicating with the Moon,
we're aiming to go back and forth

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:23.220
Sojiro Theta, Brigade of 
the West Wind - Guild Master

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:24.990
between this world and the reality...
or rather, the Earth we know, right?

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:28.540
Marielle, Crescent Moon
Alliance - Guild Master

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:28.540
Is that really possible, Shiro?

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:30.230
Shiroe, Log Horizon
 - Guild Master

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:31.080
We have no choice but to try, Marie.

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:34.120
D.D.D has a report.

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:36.690
Misa Takayama, D.D.D

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:37.540
We found a way to communicate with milord.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:39.410
With Krusty?

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:41.830
He's on the continent, right?

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:45.160
To think that he's with Kanami, of all people...

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:50.330
Once we get in touch with him,
we'll give you a detailed report on a later day.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:52.830
Isaac, Black Sword 
Knights - Guild Master

