00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:48.330
but since they were controlled
using a complex timetable,

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:52.580
cheat-sheet sites were a must back
when this world was a game.

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:57.370
After the Apocalypse, we haven't
been able to check the timetable

00:04:57.370 --> 00:05:00.950
so Honesty took charge of investigating it.

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:06.910
However, despite the large sum of money spent,
they couldn't get results.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:11.330
I heard there are people who call them leeches.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:14.910
It's not Honesty's fault, though...

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:17.120
But...

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.910
...Honesty has been growing by
taking in those who left minor guilds

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:25.240
and wandering Adventurers who arrived in Akiba.

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:28.620
I think that's also one of
the reasons they provoke antipathy.

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:34.240
Eins is probably just trying to help
the Adventurers who're having a hard time

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:36.790
getting accustomed to this world, though.

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:40.830
Hey, Shiro!

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:42.830
There are guests in Aki--

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:46.700
My groupies are here, so Naotsugu is jealous!

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:53.040
They are nobles of the
People of the Land, right?

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.540
They remind me of the Conference of Lords.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:59.120
That crest belongs to
the Cowen Family in Maihama.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:01.330
You remember their crest?

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:07.240
I didn't infiltrate Maihama for nothing.
This is one of my powers of femininity.

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:10.580
My lord...?

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.970
Café
Suzunari

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:13.700
Princess!

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:17.120
You're late, Elissa. Hurry up and put your--

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:20.910
From Maihama...
Madam Sarariya has come to visit you.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:25.450
Suifuu Mansion - Akiba

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:29.660
It has been a while, Mother.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:35.660
It seems that you have been
living here safe and sound, Rayneshia.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.290
I am very happy to see it.

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:40.910
Sarariya Tsuleu-Arte Cowen.

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:44.330
She's the mother of our purrincess?

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:46.830
She's been known for her talents from youth

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:50.200
and is called the "Pearl of Eastal."

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:55.450
I heard that Lord Serjiad said,
"I wish Sarariya was a man..."

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:59.290
She's been helping Grandfather
with state affairs since childhood.

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:01.990
She makes use of her talents,
particularly in diplomacy,

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:04.580
and our people have great trust in her.

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:06.620
Oh, this is delicious.

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:09.080
It is black rose tea, ma'am.

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:16.120
In accordance with her nickname,
I'm called the "Winter Rose of Eastal."

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:18.950
It seems new trade routes
are being created in each territory

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:22.370
due to the Adventurers' movements.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.910
Air routes are under development as well?

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:30.910
Hm? Oh, you must be talking about
the work of Sir Woodstock of Glendale.

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:34.080
I hear they're delivering letters.

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:41.660
How do you see the scale and
influence of the Adventurers' businesses?

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:47.540
She's my mother, but I get in
a bind because she's too good.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:51.660
I wish she'd understand how
I feel when I'm compared to her.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:55.580
I've noticed that Sir Krusty is not in town.

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:59.410
I-Is that a problem?

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:02.660
No, nothing like that.

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:09.330
You'll hear about your engagement in two weeks.

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:09.800
What?

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:14.870
It is Sir Touri of the Saiguu Family
who requested it.

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.160
He is the family head.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:20.740
Engagement... Marriage...?

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:22.870
Rayneshia.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:24.240
Y-Yes, Mother.

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:29.490
Be prepared... so there will be no regrets.

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.450
Yes, Mother.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.160
Elissa?

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.830
Yes, it is Elissa.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.240
You shouldn't do that.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:54.290
That's not going to help.
It'll just make your cheeks red and hurt.

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:57.330
Princess... Um...

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:59.830
I'm not too concerned

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:04.290
since I always knew this was going to happen.

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:08.990
Of course, I was surprised it
was the head of the Saiguu Family,

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:14.740
but it might really come
with three meals and a nap this time.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:20.370
The Saiguu Family has the
highest status in the current Yamato.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:24.240
I bet their castle is
bigger than ours in Maihama.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:30.330
You received many letters.

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:33.160
Sir Yunoki... I remember him.

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:37.830
He's a merchant in Tsukuba
and wants to have a branch in Akiba.

00:09:37.830 --> 00:09:43.490
Princess Rayneshia El-Arte Cowen,
Maihama Advisor to Akiba.

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:49.080
I'd like to conduct business.
Could you introduce me to Akiba merchants?

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:51.200
I heard that I could pursue
learning if I came to Akiba!

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:55.040
Well, I want to find a job in Akiba.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:10:01.740
I'm prepared, Princess.
Please follow your heart.

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:06.740
I think this is the season
of you doing your own things.

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:12.990
I wonder how many times a person
can burn with passion in their life...

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:16.120
A young child would jump
into conflict with their own will

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:20.740
and put forth all their might,
thinking that they were born for this purpose.

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:25.910
Just how many times do they
experience that in their entire life?

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:31.740
I think the majority of us would
not experience it even once.

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:37.240
So it's okay for you to
do what you want, Princess.

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:43.660
Getting married, doing business,
or falling in love and bearing children...

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.790
I don't know what it would be,

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:50.950
but when you rode the Griffon
controlled by that wicked man,

00:10:50.950 --> 00:10:55.040
you became a person who can fight freely.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:57.290
You'll be fine, Princess.

00:10:57.290 --> 00:11:03.830
I know you're someone who can
cross a bridge when she comes to it.

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:14.820
Log Horizon Guild Hall - Akiba

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:18.740
Well, Minori. Thank you
for always helping us out.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:20.830
I'm not doing much.

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:28.040
Not true. I just reported
to Shiroe about you helping us.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.040
Well then, if you'll excuse me.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.740
Thanks, Minori.

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:35.740
So you got the number?

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:38.870
Yeah, you should thank us.

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.840
You'd

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.840
better

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.840
not

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.840
be

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.840
goofing

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.840
off!

00:11:42.290 --> 00:11:44.540
Thirty-six people...

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:49.290
Fewer than I thought, or rather,
very few as expected...

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:52.740
It would've become a commotion
if there were many.

